  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch vec&#xED; a eur&#xF3;pskych z&#xE1;le&#x17E;itost&#xED; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Football for Gender Equality &#x2013; improving access to sport for girls</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Football for Gender Equality &#x2013; improving access to sport for girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je zameran&#xFD; na zrekon&#x161;truovanie a zariadenie &#x161;atne pre &#x17E;eny v priestoroch klubu, ktor&#xE1; bude sl&#xFA;&#x17E;i&#x165; cca 100 hr&#xE1;&#x10D;kam. Vytvoria sa aj kancel&#xE1;rske priestory pre &#x17E;ensk&#xFD; t&#xED;m futbalov&#xE9;ho klubu s modernou v&#xFD;po&#x10D;tovou a premietacou technikou. Vytvorenie priestorov pre &#x161;portov&#xE9; aktivity diev&#x10D;at a &#x17E;ien z mesta a okolia bude ma&#x165; pozit&#xED;vny vplyv na zdravie, soci&#xE1;lnu inkl&#xFA;ziu a rodov&#xFA; rovnos&#x165;. Je to osobitne d&#xF4;le&#x17E;it&#xE9; najm&#xE4; v ekonomicky menej rozvinutej a silne patriarch&#xE1;lnej &#x10D;asti krajiny.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to renovate and equip a women&apos;s locker room in the club premises, which will serve about 100 female players. It will also create office space for the women&apos;s football team with modern computer and projection technology. The creation of spaces for sporting activities for girls and women from the town and the surrounding area will have a positive impact on health, social inclusion and gender equality. This is particularly important in an economically less developed and highly patriarchal part of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
